{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv","level":"B1","topic":"Passiv","title":{"de":"Das Passiv: werden + Partizip II","bn":"Passive voice: werden + Partizip II"},"summary":"কে করছে নয়, কী হচ্ছে: Das Auto wird repariert / wurde repariert.","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"Passive voice-এ কে কাজটি করছে, তার চেয়ে কী কাজ হচ্ছে সেটির ওপর গুরুত্ব দেওয়া হয়।"},{"kind":"text","text":"বাংলা: „কেউ গাড়িটি মেরামত করছে“ → „গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হচ্ছে।“"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Present passive","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Der Mechaniker repariert das Auto.","en":"The mechanic repairs the car.","bn":"মেকানিক গাড়িটি মেরামত করছে।"},{"de":"Das Auto wird repariert.","en":"The car is being repaired.","bn":"গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হচ্ছে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"Structure: Subject + werden-এর সঠিক রূপ + Partizip II"}]},{"heading":"Past passive","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Das Auto wurde repariert.","en":"The car was repaired.","bn":"গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হয়েছিল।"}]},{"kind":"list","items":["wird = present passive","wurde = past passive","repariert = Partizip II"]},{"kind":"text","text":"আরেকটি উদাহরণ:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Die E-Mail wird geschrieben.","en":"The email is being written.","bn":"ইমেইলটি লেখা হচ্ছে।"},{"de":"Die E-Mail wurde geschrieben.","en":"The email was written.","bn":"ইমেইলটি লেখা হয়েছিল।"}]}]}],"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Auto ___ repariert. (হচ্ছে)","options":["wird","wurde","ist"],"answer":0,"explanation":"present passive: wird + Partizip II।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Auto ___ repariert. (হয়েছিল)","options":["wird","wurde","werden"],"answer":1,"explanation":"past passive: wurde + Partizip II।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Passive গঠনের সূত্র কোনটি?","options":["haben + Infinitiv","werden + Partizip II","sein + Infinitiv"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Passiv = werden + Partizip II।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Die E-Mail wird geschrieben.“ মানে কী?","options":["ইমেইলটি লেখা হচ্ছে।","ইমেইলটি লেখা হয়েছিল।","আমি ইমেইল লিখি।"],"answer":0,"explanation":"wird + Partizip II = present passive।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Passive voice-এ কিসের ওপর গুরুত্ব বেশি?","options":["কে কাজটি করছে","কী কাজ হচ্ছে","কখন কাজটি হবে"],"answer":1,"explanation":"কাজটির ওপর গুরুত্ব।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Briefe ___ gestern geschrieben.","options":["werden","wird","wurden"],"answer":2,"explanation":"বহুবচন + অতীত: wurden + Partizip II।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"b1-grammar-passiv","level":"B1","test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Auto ___ repariert. (হচ্ছে)","options":["wird","wurde","ist"],"answer":0,"explanation":"present passive: wird + Partizip II।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Auto ___ repariert. (হয়েছিল)","options":["wird","wurde","werden"],"answer":1,"explanation":"past passive: wurde + Partizip II।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Passive গঠনের সূত্র কোনটি?","options":["haben + Infinitiv","werden + Partizip II","sein + Infinitiv"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Passiv = werden + Partizip II।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Die E-Mail wird geschrieben.“ মানে কী?","options":["ইমেইলটি লেখা হচ্ছে।","ইমেইলটি লেখা হয়েছিল।","আমি ইমেইল লিখি।"],"answer":0,"explanation":"wird + Partizip II = present passive।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Passive voice-এ কিসের ওপর গুরুত্ব বেশি?","options":["কে কাজটি করছে","কী কাজ হচ্ছে","কখন কাজটি হবে"],"answer":1,"explanation":"কাজটির ওপর গুরুত্ব।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-passiv-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Briefe ___ gestern geschrieben.","options":["werden","wird","wurden"],"answer":2,"explanation":"বহুবচন + অতীত: wurden + Partizip II।"}]}